  "description": {
   "en": "Anzu Nakamori came to Tokyo from a farmhouse in Aomori, dreaming of becoming an amazing model. When she arrives in Tokyo with her head full of dreams, she is delighted to discover that the stylish place she's going to live is a shared house! But when she opens the door to her new home, she finds a man standing there shirtless! An odd first meeting, but one that could lead to something interesting...\n\n(Source: Shinchosha, translated)"
